            "level": {
              "value": 2
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Choose a swashbuckler's style. You gain the panache class feature, and you can gain panache in all the ways a swashbuckler of your style can. You become trained in Acrobatics or the skill associated with your style. If you were already trained in both skills, you instead become trained in a skill of your choice.\n\nYou also become trained in swashbuckler class DC. You don't gain any other effects of your chosen style."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
